{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"a1-practice-8","level":"A1","kind":"fill","title":{"de":"Wortschatz: Wohnen 1","bn":"শব্দভান্ডার: বাসস্থান ১"},"questions":[{"type":"gap","prompt":"Das ist ___ Küche.","answers":["die"],"options":["die","der","das"],"promptBn":"রান্নাঘরটি","explanation":"Küche Feminine: die Küche।","id":"a1-practice-8-q1"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Das ist ___ Kühlschrank.","answers":["ein"],"options":["ein","eine","einen"],"promptBn":"একটি ফ্রিজ","explanation":"der Kühlschrank → ein Kühlschrank।","id":"a1-practice-8-q2"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Das ist ___ Wohnung.","answers":["eine"],"options":["eine","ein","einen"],"promptBn":"একটি অ্যাপার্টমেন্ট","explanation":"die Wohnung → eine Wohnung।","id":"a1-practice-8-q3"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Der ___ ist hier. (চাবি)","answers":["Schlüssel"],"options":["Schlüssel","Stuhl","Garten"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে Noun বেছে নিন","id":"a1-practice-8-q4"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Die ___ ist hier. (শাওয়ার)","answers":["Dusche"],"options":["Dusche","Toilette","Küche"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে Noun বেছে নিন","id":"a1-practice-8-q5"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Der ___ ist freundlich. (প্রতিবেশী)","answers":["Nachbar"],"options":["Nachbar","Vermieter","Mieter"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে Noun বেছে নিন","id":"a1-practice-8-q6"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Der ___ ist groß. (বাগান)","answers":["Garten"],"options":["Garten","Baum","Raum"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে Noun বেছে নিন","id":"a1-practice-8-q7"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Das ist ___ Aufzug.","answers":["der"],"options":["der","die","das"],"promptBn":"লিফটটি","explanation":"Aufzug Masculine: der Aufzug।","id":"a1-practice-8-q8"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Der Zug kommt ___ neun Uhr.","answers":["um"],"options":["um","auf","nach"],"promptBn":"নয়টায়","explanation":"ঘড়ির সময়ের আগে um।","id":"a1-practice-8-q9"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich stehe um ___ Uhr auf. (৬)","answers":["sechs"],"options":["sechs","fünf","sieben"],"promptBn":"সংখ্যা","id":"a1-practic